From 8a560584fd2edc675a8b150378bd2d8d6040b616 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Harshkamdar67 <harshkamdar67@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 11:28:17 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 02/32] vulkan: accept non-contiguous SCALE input and add an
 integer-dot mat-vec path for IQ4_NL

SCALE required a contiguous source, so the SITU activation of Inkling 2 (a scale of a view
of the fused gate/up output) ran on the CPU twice per layer visit: 194 graph splits.
IQ4_NL had no MMVQ pipelines although IQ4_XS and MXFP4 do; on Xe2 with the Windows
driver it is used at one token as well.
---
 ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp              | 11 ++++++++++-
 .../ggml-vulkan/vulkan-shaders/mul_mat_vecq.comp  |  2 +-
 .../vulkan-shaders/mul_mat_vecq_funcs.glsl        | 15 ++++++++++++++-
 ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/vulkan-shaders/scale.comp    |  2 +-
 .../vulkan-shaders/vulkan-shaders-gen.cpp         |  4 ++--
 5 files changed, 28 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

